  "query_preview": "..\n(Friday through next Wednesday)\nIssued at 1032 PM CDT Tue Oct 13 2026\n\nA cold front that lags behind the mid-week moisture is expected to \nswing through at the end of the weekend give us a real taste of \nfall. We're looking at highs in the 60s/70s and lows in the 30s and \n40s for the weekend. Sunday morning, we could see our first frost of \nthe season on the Cumberland Plateau. Sadly, it will only be a taste \nof fall, as the return of clearer skies will also bring back the \nheat. Highs by mid-week next week will creep back up into \nthe upper 70s.",
